The annual meeting of the LLG has been held by email since 2005, and the membership of the LLG agreed that after 2007, this practice would be continued. The email record, which since 2007 has been deemed to satisfy the requirement for minutes, is available to members in the [http://mail.lojban.org/mailman/private/llg-members|archives]. Since the transition from formal minutes, there have been repeated requests for summaries of proceedings, but to date, only one such summary has been published, for the 2009 meeting. It was accepted as minutes according to the proceedings of the 2010 meeting.

!!!Summaries
!!!!Email meetings
* 2013: ((LLG Meeting Summary 2013|Annual Meeting)) from January 19 - March 21, 2014
* 2012: ((LLG Meeting Summary 2012|Annual Meeting)) from October 26 - December 11, 2012
* 2011: Meeting conducted via llg-members from October 9 - November 14, 2011 (summary forthcoming)
* 2010: ((LLG Meeting Topics 2010|Annual Meeting)) called to Order August 21, 2010 (proposed agenda only, no record of proceedings)
!!!Minutes
